abels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/milestones/116/labels","id":1091077,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lMTA5MTA3Nw==","number":116,"title":"4.0.29.Final","description":"","creator":{"login":"normanmaurer","id":439362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM2Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/439362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer","html_url":"https://github.com/normanmaurer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":60,"state":"closed","created_at":"2015-04-30T13:26:30Z","updated_at":"2015-09-09T19:53:07Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2015-06-23T10:02:18Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2015-05-19T12:51:58Z","updated_at":"2015-05-25T19:43:14Z","closed_at":"2015-05-25T19:43:14Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Netty 4.0.28.final\n\nWhile working with Direct/Heap buffer, I've encountered this situation in the java doc.\n\nOn line 74 in io.netty.util.internal.PlatformDependent, the property loaded for Direct or Heap buffer for the used Allocator is like this\n\n```\nprivate static final boolean DIRECT_BUFFER_PREFERRED =\n        HAS_UNSAFE && !SystemPropertyUtil.getBoolean(\"io.netty.noPreferDirect\", false);\n```\n\nBut when going down to the getter of DIRECT_BUFFER_PREFERRED field, on line 152-158 the Java doc goes like this\n\n```\n/**\n * Returns {@code true} if the platform has reliable low-level direct buffer access API and a user specified\n * {@code -Dio.netty.preferDirect} option.\n */\n```\n\nThe two options stated have different name. Also, it's a bit confusing using the negate form in the first one \"io.netty.noPreferDirect\". It's then to double negate when trying to use an Allocator with HeapBuffer instead of DirectBuffer.\n","closed_by":{"login":"normanmaurer","id":439362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM2Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/439362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer","html_url":"https://github.com/normanmaurer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/3805/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/3805/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}